      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im talking to you. everything is fine on paper. i have a good job and my family is great and i should be happy but i just feel... nothing. everything is just gray. it's like i'm watching my own life through a thick pane of glass and i can't feel anything anymore. it's exhausting.",
