      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how incredibly heavy and isolating that feeling of emptiness and the thought that the world must stop to end the pain must be. Please know that your life matters even when it feels like it's just a gray routine, and your distress is valid regardless of your outside circumstances. Because you're thinking about making it stop, please reach out to a crisis line right now so someone can listen without judgment.",
      "source": "target",
