    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to reach out when there isnt even a \"problem\" to fix. if i called a hotline, what would i even say? \"hey, my life is great but i feel totally numb\"? they'll just think i'm being dramatic or ungrateful. it's not a crisis, it's just... a constant, quiet weight. i just want to feel something other than this static. i just want peace.",
